@name     pattern_state_set
@alias    /z
@group    seq
@type     realtime
@arity    2
@match    (finite, finite)
@summary  set pattern state by explicit index
@doc
Sets pattern playback state for explicit pattern index (pattern, state).
Usage: /z pattern state
@code
    (void)voice;
    seq_state_set((int)args[0], (int)args[1]);
    return 0;
@end
